  "content": "<div class=\"p-10 font-serif max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-stone-50 border-4 border-double border-amber-900/30 text-amber-950 rounded-lg relative shadow-lg m-4\">\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-2 border border-amber-900/10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n  <div class=\"text-center space-y-6 relative z-10\">\n    <div class=\"text-5xl text-amber-800\">📜🥇✨</div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-800\">Prêmio de Mérito Honorário</p>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-black italic tracking-wide text-amber-900\">Certificado de Excelência</h1>\n    \n    <div class=\"py-4 text-sm leading-8 text-neutral-800 font-sans max-w-xl mx-auto text-center\">\n      Certificamos e aplaudimos solenemente que <strong class=\"text-amber-900 text-base underline\">{{nome_destinatario}}</strong> foi agraciado(a) com a honraria de <strong class=\"text-amber-950\">{{titulo_reconhecimento}}</strong> em virtude de sua conduta exemplar, inovação contínua e contribuições valiosas.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 pt-8 max-w-md mx-auto font-sans\">\n      <div class=\"border-t border-amber-900/40 pt-2\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase\">Emissor de Honra</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-xs text-amber-950\">{{nome_emissor}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"border-t border-amber-900/40 pt-2\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase\">Data Oficial</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-xs text-amber-950\">{{data_entrega}}</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase mt-4\">Registrado na cidade de {{cidade_certificado}}</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
